{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shovel Lands</strong> is a <strong>fast-paced 2D digging platformer</strong>. <strong>Dig, dash, and fight</strong> your way through a world full of obstacles and danger. Explore and uncover the mystery behind the corrupted crystals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is inspired by games like Celeste, Donkey Kong Country or Ori. Dig your way through <strong>handcrafted levels</strong> and enjoy the visually striking art and music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792380/extras/67b67246061f96ee8fe0de3888b3ed72.poster.avif?t=1774260051\" width=800 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792380/extras/67b67246061f96ee8fe0de3888b3ed72.webm?t=1774260051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792380/extras/67b67246061f96ee8fe0de3888b3ed72.mp4?t=1774260051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792380/extras/9d1f16d167c473b2ecde95a379891777.poster.avif?t=1774260051\" width=800 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792380/extras/9d1f16d167c473b2ecde95a379891777.webm?t=1774260051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792380/extras/9d1f16d167c473b2ecde95a379891777.mp4?t=1774260051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\